{"4455780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moonlight Dialogue", "steam_appid": 4455780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our game is designed to be played in portrait mode.</strong> 📱✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455780/extras/377510c6f44a2527f7b44e6dcff1859d.avif?t=1784254819\" width=1024 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After leaving your job, you took a refreshing trip to Busan—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and there, you stumbled upon an unexpected connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious as ever, you turned that coincidence into fate, and that’s how we met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then came the nightmares that began to haunt you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the night deepens, people’s worries grow clearer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast counseling center bathed in moonlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There, you take on the role of the Finder, falling in love with participants, weaving their stories, and uncovering hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455780/extras/ee89230ac14e4568b78b60e4f49e264a.poster.avif?t=1784254819\" width=720 height=898 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455780/extras/ee89230ac14e4568b78b60e4f49e264a.webm?t=1784254819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455780/extras/ee89230ac14e4568b78b60e4f49e264a.mp4?t=1784254819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455780/extras/3380c6c1969068c70a3bfa417681cccb.avif?t=1784254819\" width=1242 height=2688 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Chat-based interactive simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Emotional bonds with characters and branching choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A story of uncovering hidden truths and mysteries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Warm, dreamlike art and a heartfelt original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This app is a work of fiction and does not provide professional medical counseling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455780/extras/f84438cddd91b5cc3c7dfd7a00e1b2a2.avif?t=1784254819\" width=1500 height=1500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455780/extras/f25eb907edbfeeee0af31be1ee1ae931.avif?t=1784254819\" width=1170 height=2064 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yoon Ji-won — a warm-hearted yet fragile hospital intern</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ryu Soo-ha — a playful drummer with hidden depths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choi Bom — a bright and honest dreamer juggling multiple jobs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Han Yu-chae — a diplomat who approaches you with steady sincerity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ji Seo-jun — a composed researcher who keeps his distance yet watches you closely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheon Ha-baek, who embraces everything with kind eyes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kang San-ya, dangerous and enigmatic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through conversations with them, your choices bring you closer together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As affinity grows, relationships shift into something more special—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and your decisions open the door to new stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455780/extras/a4839a5a1b2cd3411a430d565139529d.avif?t=1784254819\" width=1170 height=2064 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455780/extras/9da1b2eb24fbc04d085c683c8eab15ac.avif?t=1784254819\" width=400 height=889 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access version features branching date events for Jiwon and Sooha, as well as Jiwon's endings (a total of over 15 endings, including 11 bad endings alongside other ending variations).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455780/extras/bd955bfc8c9e310cd0d443bbfc67df90.poster.avif?t=1784254819\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455780/extras/bd955bfc8c9e310cd0d443bbfc67df90.webm?t=1784254819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455780/extras/bd955bfc8c9e310cd0d443bbfc67df90.mp4?t=1784254819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our game is designed to be played in portrait mode.</strong> 📱✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455780/extras/377510c6f44a2527f7b44e6dcff1859d.avif?t=1784254819\" width=1024 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After leavi